        "id": 4700
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-22T19:04:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I need a human readable unique identifier to be used in the policies.\nSo it\u0027s not a problem (and on purpose) but the hostnames are quite long, what would you think of stripping the suffix \".wmnet/.wikimedia.org\" for the sake of simplicity?",
